 "_about": "Which brands get a weekly business review deck, and on which day. Read by the scheduled deck tasks (Monday: Dormeo; Sunday: every other brand). A brand runs only when enabled is true AND its runbook exists. googleSlidesId = the brand's ONE editable Google Slides file (same link every week). The deck run never writes to it: the Apps Script in _tools/apps-script (Ron's Google account, every 30 minutes) rebuilds it from the published slides-requests.json.gz. pictureSlidesId = the old picture-only copy, kept for reference and no longer updated. To add a brand: build _tools/<slug>-deck/ (copy dormeo-canada-deck), publish once by hand, set enabled to true here, run `deck.py index` and push decks.json; the Apps Script then creates the brand's editable file on its next run and logs its id: put that id in googleSlidesId and publish again. terminated = Flagship no longer manages the brand: never enable.",
